# The test fixture workspace carries its own pyproject.toml (pins the
# uv-run-hassle branch of the CLI invocation fallback chain, polish-batch
# item 1) -- a `uv.lock` can get generated alongside it by an incidental
# `uv` invocation with cwd under this directory; it's disposable, never
# part of the fixture's actual contract (every test mocks the CLI
# subprocess, real `uv`/`hassle` never runs).
src/test/suite/fixtureWorkspace/uv.lock
